# Audit History Index

File: openOODA/docs/audit-history/ANCHOR.oo

The full multi-agent self-audit history for openOODA lives under
`/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/.agents/` on the maintainer's local
workspace and is **gitignored** in every repo (see RULES.oot §1.10
"Negative Trust & Adversarial Validation"). This file is the curated,
public-facing index of milestones.

## 1. 8-D Red Team Audit Waves

The 8-D Red Team protocol (`practices/8d-red-team.oot`) ran in four
distinct waves during the openOODA bootstrapping period:

| Wave | Auditors | Challengers | Reviewers | Verdict |
|------|----------|-------------|-----------|---------|
| M1   | `auditor_m1/`, `auditor_m1_2/`, `auditor_m1_3/` | `challenger_m1_1/..m1_6/` | `reviewer_m1_1/..m1_6/` | passed |
| M2   | `auditor_m2/`, `auditor_m2_gen3/`, `auditor_m2_iter2/` | `challenger_m2_1/..m2_iter2_2/` | `reviewer_m2_1/..m2_iter2_2/` | passed |
| M3   | `auditor_m3/`, `auditor_m3_iter2/` | `challenger_m3_1/..m3_iter2_2/` | `reviewer_m3_1/..m3_iter2_2/` | passed |
| M4   | `auditor_m4/`, `auditor_m4_gate/`, `auditor_m4_rem/` | `challenger_m4_gate_1/..m4_rem_2/` | `reviewer_m4_1/..m4_rem_2/` | passed |

The `auditor_m4_rem/` wave specifically targeted remediation of findings
from the previous waves; the `auditor_m4_gate/` wave is the release-gate.

## 2. Spec-Miner Reports

Subsystem scoping reports, one per major component:

- `spec_miner_oodar/`     — Gen 1 C host substrate (cap tokens, Landlock, PQC)
- `spec_miner_blackbox/`  — Operational Logistics / flight recorder
- `spec_miner_rfc/`       — RFC scoping for the 7 adopted RFCs (0001..0007)

## 3. Victory-Audit Checkpoints

End-of-milestone closure gates run by `victory_auditor_{1,2,3}/`. These
produce the green-light signal before the next wave begins.

## 4. Cross-References

| Audit informed | File |
|----------------|------|
| Capability token lattice (20+26) | `rfcs/0001-capability-security.oot` |
| File-format and 256-line cap | `rfcs/0003-file-format.oot` |
| Design by contract | `rfcs/0002-design-by-contract.oot` |
| 3-Layer architecture | `rfcs/0004-engineering-model.oot` |
| Versioning and release protocol | `rfcs/0006-versioning-and-release-protocol.oot` |
| Blackbox flight recorder | `rfcs/0007-blackbox-flight-recorder.oot` |
| Double-run invariant | `RULES.oot` §1.10 + `practices/8d-red-team.oot` |

## 5. Source

The full transcripts (~5.5 MB across 106 subdirectories) are retained
locally for maintainer reference. They are not part of the published
polyrepo by design — per RULES.oot §1.7 "Verified on-disk features are
recorded by the per-repo shipped proof scripts," the proof of work is
in the test gates, not the audit transcripts.
